 Base64 Decoder ->
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
In SAP Cloud Platform Integration (CPI), the Base64 Decoder is used to convert a Base64 encoded string
back into its original binary form. This is often necessary when transmitting binary data
(like images or files) over systems that only support text-based communication

use case :
Assume that you like to add an image to a product details message and you like to transfer this message to
a medium that only works with textual data.


